  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A quiet tracker you can keep open all day",
    "rules": [
      "Chrome is pale, content is contrasty. Colour carries meaning — type, priority, status — never decoration. At most one accent per screen.",
      "Separate with space and very faint borders, not heavy rules or card shadows.",
      "Dense without crowding: 13px base and compact controls, but generous outer padding.",
      "Every user action lands in the UI immediately and optimistically; the network catches up. A spinner only where there is nothing to show.",
      "No decorative illustration, emoji, or gradient fill. The login radial glow is the one exception in the entire product.",
      "The keyboard is first class. Everything clickable is operable from the keyboard and has a focus style.",
      "Never introduce a colour by eye. New shades come from color-mix(in oklab, <token> N%, transparent).",
      "At most two background levels in one plane.",
      "Text nodes set their colour explicitly; nothing inherits it by accident.",
      "Entrance animations never hide content: no opacity:0 first frame, no fill-mode that leaves an element invisible.",
      "Nothing bounces, springs, or runs longer than 250ms."
    ]
  }
